{
  "version": "1",
  "description": "Desiderata-based masking (Davies et al. 2023, arXiv:2307.03637) over the attention heads of Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B at the readout token '=' of NN+MM=. swaps gives the ceilings and the check sets by exact head swaps; fit_all fits one head mask per L1 weight over all 48 heads of the six full-attention layers and apply_all_<w> scores each; fit_l15 and apply_l15_<w> do the same over layer 15's 8 heads; random_<s> draws five random 3-head masks at layer 15 and apply_random_<s> scores them. Every score is on the held-out split. scripts/addition_heads_dbm/heads_figure.py draws the figure from the run tree.",
